# Local artifacts and test output — never part of a deployment.
#
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored
# `projects` also matches apps/web/app/projects/, which silently removes
# application source from the upload and fails the build with a
# "Module not found" that points at a file which plainly exists locally.
node_modules
.git
.turbo
*.log

/exports
/uploads
/backups
/coverage
/artifacts
/projects
/docs
/certs

/apps/mobile
/apps/api/exports
/apps/api/uploads
/apps/api/dist
/apps/web/.next
/apps/web/.next-verify
/apps/web/out
/packages/shared/dist

*.docx
*.apk
*.aab
